(DEFINE (SPECIAL-DYNAMICS-OF STEP-MOTHER IN (SUBSCENE-OF JUSTICE 1)) SPECIAL-DYNAMICS (SET YOUR OFFSPRING TO (|(SPECIAL-DYNAMICS-OF STEP-MOTHER IN (SUBSCENE-OF JUSTICE 1))-3|)) (SET YOUR PATH-JAGGEDNESS TO MEDIUM) (SET YOUR PATH-CURVATURE TO LOW) (SET YOUR PATH-LENGTH TO MEDIUM) (SET YOUR DELIBERATENESS TO HIGH) (SET YOUR REPETIVENESS TO MEDIUM) (SET YOUR ACCELERATION TO HIGH) (SET YOUR RHYTHMIC-LEVEL TO MEDIUM) (SET YOUR ACTIVITY-LEVEL TO HIGH) (SET YOUR SPEED TO LOW) (SET YOUR DOMINATES TO (CINDERELLA))) 
